&lt;p&gt;Below, we dive into the core building blocks—text‑to‑speech (TTS), voice cloning, and dynamic content generation—then walk through a quick, hands‑on example using ElevenLabs’ API. By the end, you’ll have a solid foundation to start crafting your own audio ad engine.&lt;/p&gt;




