&lt;h2&gt;


  5. Voice Cloning in Practice
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Imagine you’re running a loyalty campaign and want every ad to sound like the brand’s iconic spokesperson. With ElevenLabs, you can create a clone in minutes:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Collect a short sample&lt;/strong&gt; (20–60 seconds of the target voice).
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Upload the sample&lt;/strong&gt; via the &lt;code&gt;/voice-cloning&lt;/code&gt; endpoint.
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Generate a new voice ID&lt;/strong&gt; that can be used just like any other voice.
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;div class="highlight js-code-highlight"&gt;
&lt;pre class="highlight shell"&gt;&lt;code&gt;curl -X POST https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1/voice-cloning \
  -H &lt;span class="s2"&gt;"xi-api-key: $ELEVENLABS_API_KEY"&lt;/span&gt; \
  -H &lt;span class="s2"&gt;"Content-Type: multipart/form-data"&lt;/span&gt; \
  -F &lt;span class="s2"&gt;"audio=@/path/to/sample.wav"&lt;/span&gt; \
  -F &lt;span class="s2"&gt;"model=default"&lt;/span&gt; \
  -F &lt;span class="s2"&gt;"name=MyBrandSpokesperson"&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;



&lt;p&gt;Once the clone is ready, reference the returned &lt;code&gt;voice_id&lt;/code&gt; in your synthesis calls. This lets you maintain brand consistency while still delivering personalized content.&lt;/p&gt;




