&lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vtvE_7ay2_4" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vtvE_7ay2_4&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;




&lt;h2&gt;


  3. Tooling &amp;amp; Pipeline Transparency
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;To maintain production velocity on a complex narrative RPG, we embrace a transparent hybrid development pipeline:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Codex&lt;/strong&gt;: Used as an assistive co-pilot for architectural design patterns, algorithm optimization, Canvas math, and visual layout prototyping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Veo&lt;/strong&gt;: Deployed for generating specific pre-rendered cinematic clips and dimensional rift visual sequences integrated into our synchronized playback subsystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Voice Acting &amp;amp; Audio&lt;/strong&gt;: Full localized voice acting and dynamic battle audio engineered to maintain tension across both real-time strikes and tactical pauses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;




